  "_doc": "14 October 2026: the music spectral trim (zrmd/audio/trim.py, layouts and caps in params/music-trim.json) applied to a sound-effect window by zrmd/audio/sfxspectral.py. A variant lists only what it changes over music-trim. padSeconds of zeros surround a short window so no frame is mirrored. 'fine' keeps the layouts a 0.2 to 1.8 s window can resolve (FFT up to 2048); 'full' is the music configuration unchanged (its 16384 and 24576 FFT cannot resolve a short event: with one or two frames the gain copies the periodogram of the reference, which the experiment of 14 October 2026 measures). FR : calage spectral de la musique applique a un evenement SFX.",
