   "_doc": "14 October 2026: laid over params/music-trim.json for every SFX variant. The two guards the music added the same day against an infrasonic thump on bass stems are OFF for a short effect: minResolvedBins 0 (no gain on the bins a frame cannot resolve) and highpassHz 0 (zero-phase high-pass after each pass). Measured on four Opus events (E001 kick, E003, E005, E008), shared trim alone, official score: both off 94.1 / 95.7 / 95.9 / 94.4; guard only 90.5 / 90.5 / 94.0 / 89.5; high-pass only 92.4 / 89.3 / 94.0 / 92.9; both on 91.0 / 88.5 / 93.7 / 91.1. The 18 Hz high-pass doubles the envelope error of a 0.5 s window (E003 1.10 to 2.72 JND): the reference window carries that low-frequency thump of the event. FR : les deux garde-fous de la musique sont coupes pour un effet court, mesure sur quatre evenements.",
